    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d73-a1">

                <pb facs="0231" n="1191" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1191"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 35.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mariscal to Mr. Bragg.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-05-03"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 3,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: Referring to my note of the 23d of
                    March last, relative to the complaint of the American citizen B. C. Work,
                    charged with homicide, I have the honor to inform your excellency that I have
                    just received a communication from the governor of the State of Tamaulipas,
                    dated the 10th of April, inclosing a report from the judge of first instance at
                    Ciudad Victoria, from which it appears that Work is subject to criminal process
                    for homicide he perpetrated on the person of Francisco Cruz. The following is
                    stated in that respect:</p>
                <p>“The court is endeavoring to expedite the trial, in order that proof may be
                    established touching the degree of culpability of Work, or concerning the weight
                    to be given to the points of defense raised by him. Meanwhile, he is in the
                    enjoyment of all the guaranties which the law accords to his person, and he has
                    even been permitted, in as far as is compatible with his character of accused,
                    to attend to his private business.”</p>
                <p>I protest, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Igno. Mariscal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
